@startuml
title Video Suggestion System UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Start
Start --> GatherVideos
GatherVideos --> AddDetails
AddDetails --> SendVideos

state UserRequest
UserRequest : entry / user sends request

state GatherVideos
GatherVideos : entry / gathers videos based on user's profile, trends, tags, genres, promotions

state AddDetails
AddDetails : entry / adds thumbnails and view counts to suggested videos

state SendVideos
SendVideos : entry / sends suggested videos to the user
@enduml
